{"4321390": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Last Opening", "steam_appid": 4321390, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4878020], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Game Against Death</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Death came for you. You challenged him to chess. He accepted.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you win, you may return to life. If you lose… your soul remains at the table.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4321390/extras/35940455ffbb4aa5c1851bd4608287d7.webp?t=1783263522\" width=855 height=18 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play Against Death</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each night, you make one move. Death answers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The chessboard is not separate from the world, what you sacrifice in the forest may strengthen your pieces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What you lose on the board may wound your reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rescue lost pawns in the snow. Trade pieces for warmth or supplies. Decide what is worth sacrificing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The match lasts 40 moves. Win or lose, it will end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4321390/extras/35940455ffbb4aa5c1851bd4608287d7.webp?t=1783263522\" width=855 height=18 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A World That Watches You</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each day brings something new.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A thief in the dark. A wandering merchant. A stranger offering to buy one of your pieces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A silent figure standing too close to your fire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Small decisions pile up. Mercy or cruelty. Sacrifice or greed. Trust or suspicion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will not know which choices matter most, until the end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can explore the frozen forest, but winter is merciless far from flame.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay out too long, and the cold will make its move.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4321390/extras/35940455ffbb4aa5c1851bd4608287d7.webp?t=1783263522\" width=855 height=18 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survive the Cold</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By day, you fight the wilderness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cut trees. Gather food. Feed the fire. Build and protect your camp.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The air grows sharper. The nights grow longer. Resources grow scarce.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every action costs something.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4321390/extras/16ac1b68ef6374e1d5b0c86a0b3010ff.avif?t=1783263522\" width=1000 height=600 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>This is not endless survival. It is a countdown.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Game Against Death</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Death came for you. You challenged him to chess. He accepted.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you win, you may return to life. If you lose… your soul remains at the table.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4321390/extras/35940455ffbb4aa5c1851bd4608287d7.webp?t=1783263522\" width=855 height=18 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play Against Death</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each night, you make one move. Death answers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The chessboard is not separate from the world, what you sacrifice in the forest may strengthen your pieces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What you lose on the board may wound your reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rescue lost pawns in the snow. Trade pieces for warmth or supplies. Decide what is worth sacrificing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The match lasts 40 moves. Win or lose, it will end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4321390/extras/35940455ffbb4aa5c1851bd4608287d7.webp?t=1783263522\" width=855 height=18 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A World That Watches You</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each day brings something new.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A thief in the dark. A wandering merchant. A stranger offering to buy one of your pieces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A silent figure standing too close to your fire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Small decisions pile up. Mercy or cruelty. Sacrifice or greed. Trust or suspicion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will not know which choices matter most, until the end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can explore the frozen forest, but winter is merciless far from flame.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay out too long, and the cold will make its move.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4321390/extras/35940455ffbb4aa5c1851bd4608287d7.webp?t=1783263522\" width=855 height=18 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survive the Cold</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By day, you fight the wilderness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cut trees. Gather food. Feed the fire. Build and protect your camp.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The air grows sharper. The nights grow longer. Resources grow scarce.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every action costs something.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><